
---
---

<section class="difference-section">
  <div class="difference-header">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">THE EURO DECOR DIFFERENCE</span>
      <h2>SIX REASONS TO THINK<br />BEYOND THE SURFACE.</h2>
    </div>

    <p class="difference-intro">
      Our approach brings together design, material possibilities and
      customer support to help turn interior concepts into considered spaces.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="reasons-grid">
    <div class="reason">
      <div class="reason-number">01 <span></span></div>
      <h3>Premium</h3>
      <p>Decorative veneers and laminates selected to bring sophistication and character to interiors.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reason">
      <div class="reason-number">02 <span></span></div>
      <h3>Innovative</h3>
      <p>Evolving designs, colour choices and finishes that respond to changing interior trends.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reason">
      <div class="reason-number">03 <span></span></div>
      <h3>Refined</h3>
      <p>Surfaces that balance texture, visual appeal and thoughtful design.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reason">
      <div class="reason-number">04 <span></span></div>
      <h3>Bespoke</h3>
      <p>A range of design possibilities to complement different project requirements.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reason">
      <div class="reason-number">05 <span></span></div>
      <h3>Reliable</h3>
      <p>A focus on quality control, product knowledge and customer support.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reason">
      <div class="reason-number">06 <span></span></div>
      <h3>Nationwide</h3>
      <p>A distribution network connecting customers with Euro Decor products across India.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="quality-section">
  <div class="quality-left">
    <span class="eyebrow">OUR QUALITY POLICY</span>

    <h2>QUALITY IS IN<br />EVERY DETAIL.</h2>

    <p>
      Consistency and quality control are central to Euro Decor’s
      manufacturing approach. The production process is monitored by
      quality-control personnel, with computerised product checking
      included in the quality-assurance process.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="quality-right">
    <div class="quality-item">
      <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
      <div>
        <span class="quality-label">QUALITY STANDARD / 01</span>
        <h3>Consistency</h3>
        <p>Maintaining consistency throughout the production and quality-control process.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quality-item">
      <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
      <div>
        <span class="quality-label">QUALITY STANDARD / 02</span>
        <h3>Monitoring</h3>
        <p>Production processes monitored by qualified quality-control personnel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quality-item">
      <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
      <div>
        <span class="quality-label">QUALITY STANDARD / 03</span>
        <h3>Inspection</h3>
        <p>Computerised product checking as part of the quality-assurance process.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .difference-section {
    background: #f7f4f1;
    padding: 80px 3.2%;
    color: #38271f;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #95613e;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .difference-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7%;
    margin-bottom: 65px;
  }

  .difference-header h2,
  .quality-left h2 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 4.2vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #38271f;
  }

  .difference-intro {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 2;
    color: #755f54;
    margin: 35px 0 0;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .reasons-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    column-gap: 3.3%;
    row-gap: 0;
  }

  .reason {
    border-top: 1px solid #d1bfb0;
    padding: 42px 0 40px;
  }

  .reason-number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #95613e;
  }

  .reason-number span {
    width: 66px;
    height: 1px;
    background: #c8b4a4;
  }

  .reason h3 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 32px 0 20px;
    color: #38271f;
  }

  .reason p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #755f54;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Quality Policy */

  .quality-section {
    background: #f0e9e3;
    padding: 85px 3.2% 110px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 8%;
    color: #38271f;
  }

  .quality-left {
    padding-top: 3px;
  }

  .quality-left .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .quality-left h2 {
    margin-bottom: 38px;
  }

  .quality-left > p {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 2.1;
    color: #755f54;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .quality-right {
    border-top: 1px solid #d1bfb0;
  }

  .quality-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 65px 1fr;
    gap: 34px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 43px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d1bfb0;
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border: 1px solid #cbb7a7;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #95613e;
    font-size: 21px;
  }

  .quality-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #95613e;
  }

  .quality-item h3 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 31px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 15px 0 18px;
    color: #38271f;
  }

  .quality-item p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #755f54;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Tablet */

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .difference-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .difference-intro {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .quality-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 55px;
    }

    .reasons-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      column-gap: 6%;
    }
  }

  /* Mobile */

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .difference-section,
    .quality-section {
      padding: 60px 6%;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .difference-header h2,
    .quality-left h2 {
      font-size: 39px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .difference-intro,
    .quality-left > p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .reasons-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .reason {
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    .reason h3 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin: 25px 0 15px;
    }

    .reason p,
    .quality-item p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .quality-item {
      grid-template-columns: 45px 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 32px 0;
    }

    .check-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .quality-item h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .quality-label {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
